            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>When the only operations are multiplication and division, we carry out the operations from left to right, using parentheses <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (\\cdots)]</span> to make our working clearer:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 36 \u00f7 6 \u00d7 10|=; (36 \u00f7 6) \u00d7 10|=; 6 \u00d7 10|=; 60]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "When the only operations are multiplication and division, we carry out the operations from left to right, using parentheses [MATH: (\\cdots)] to make our working clearer:\n\n[MATH: 36 \u00f7 6 \u00d7 10|=; (36 \u00f7 6) \u00d7 10|=; 6 \u00d7 10|=; 60]",
            "images": [],
